---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";
import Term from "../components/Term.astro";
import Demo from "../components/Demo.astro";
import VideoDemo from "../components/VideoDemo.astro";
import Flow from "../components/Flow.astro";
import AudSplit from "../components/AudSplit.astro";
import Convo from "../components/Convo.astro";
const GH = "https://github.com/wookat/witness";
---
<Base>
<Hero />

<div class="ruler"><b class="a">00:00</b><b class="b">REC</b><i style="--x:12%"></i></div>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap center">
  <div class="kicker">01 · The problem</div>
  <h2 class="rv">Agents can't see what you see.</h2>
  <p class="lede rv" data-d="100">A human notices “the button fades weirdly when I scroll” in two seconds. Writing that up for an AI agent takes ten minutes of screenshots, element selectors and prompt crafting — and the result still loses the <i>why</i>. Voice is the cheapest annotation channel there is; it just never had a recorder.</p>
</div></section>

<div class="ruler"><b class="a">00:18</b><i style="--x:34%"></i></div>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">02 · Watch it happen</div>
  <h2 class="rv">One click. Every consequence, filed.</h2>
  <p class="lede rv" data-d="80">This is a real recorded session — speech, marking, the dead click, the save. The Pay button below produces <b>nothing</b>, and that absence is captured as fact.</p>
  <div style="margin-top:52px"><VideoDemo /></div>
</div></section>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><b>3</b><span>recording tracks</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>10</b><span>MCP tools</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>0</b><span>cloud keys needed</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>17</b><span>tests green</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>MIT</b><span>open source</span></div>
</div>

<section id="how" class="alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">03 · How it works</div>
  <h2 class="rv">Three recording lines, one timeline.</h2>
  <p class="lede rv" data-d="80"><code>wit start &lt;dev-url&gt;</code> opens a managed browser. From that moment, three streams run in parallel — zero manual work:</p>
  <div class="grid g3">
    <Card icon="mic" n="01 / VOICE" title="Your voice" d="0">Continuous audio + <b>true streaming ASR</b> (doubao-web → doubao-ime → browser SR, auto-fallback). Live subtitles under the toolbar as you speak — one take, many issues, no need to split.</Card>
    <Card icon="zap" n="02 / OPS" title="Operations + causal bursts" d="80">Every click captures its ~1.8s aftermath: requests, responses, console errors, DOM changes. A click with <i>no</i> aftermath is itself evidence.</Card>
    <Card icon="layers" n="03 / STATE" title="Page evolution" d="160">rrweb full-DOM replay + event-driven screenshots + periodic DOM snapshots. Rewind the exact page state at any second.</Card>
  </div>
  <Flow />
</div></section>

<div class="ruler"><b class="a">01:12</b><i style="--x:71%"></i></div>

<section id="evidence"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">04 · The output</div>
  <h2 class="rv">Your words become evidence anchors.</h2>
  <p class="lede rv" data-d="80">Each spoken fragment becomes a block on a timeline with the causal facts of that moment attached — the “causal burst”. Click a quote:</p>
  <Demo />
</div></section>

<div class="ruler"><b class="a">01:48</b><b class="b">SAY ×3</b><i style="--x:82%"></i></div>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">05 · Two audiences</div>
  <h2 class="rv">Humans get a replay. Agents get a structure.</h2>
  <AudSplit
    humans={[
      ["review.html","speech cards + audio seek + shots",{img:"/sample/review.png",cap:"a real review.html — captured while recording this very site"}],
      ["▶ DOM replay","embedded rrweb player, real page states",{img:"/sample/review.png",cap:"the rrweb replay area inside review.html"}],
      ["film strip","scrub the session like a video",{img:"/sample/review.png",cap:"the film-strip scrubber"}],
      ["audio.webm","the original take",{img:"/sample/review.png",cap:"click any speech card to play that moment"}],
    ]}
    agents={[
      ["PROMPT.md","handoff instructions + page vocabulary",{pre:`这是 Witness 录制的一段产品体验反馈（voice + click + 页面实况证据链）。

请按以下顺序处理：
1. 读 session.md —— 时间轴：每段语音（SAY）下方挂该时刻的证据
2. 先把用户指出的问题复述成清单，请用户确认后再动手
3. 用户确认后逐条修复`,cap:"real PROMPT.md excerpt — the agent must echo the issue list before fixing"}],
      ["session.md","the causal evidence timeline",{pre:`### 00:17 · SAY
> [00:17] "就比如说这个淋巴的话"
> [00:21] "AI 硬件的交互我觉得有问题"
- 00:24 CLICK #install > div.term > pre
  - 00:24 MUT #rot attr class: rot → rot out`,cap:"real session.md excerpt — evidence hangs under each SAY"}],
      ["events.jsonl","complete raw stream, crash-safe",{pre:`{"kind":"req","id":1,"url":"https://witness.zalize.com/zh/","method":"GET","t":605}
{"kind":"nav","url":"https://witness.zalize.com/zh/","t":1413}
{"kind":"click","selector":"#install > div.term > pre","x":1106,"y":595,"t":24483}`,cap:"events.jsonl streams to disk line by line"}],
      ["dom/ · bodies/ · shots/","snapshots, payloads, frames",{img:"/sample/shot.jpg",cap:"a real frame from shots/"}],
    ]} />
</div></section>

<section id="mcp"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">06 · Pull, don't push</div>
  <h2 class="rv"><code>wit mcp</code> — evidence as an API.</h2>
  <p class="lede rv" data-d="80">Instead of a static dump, the session becomes a stdio MCP server. Point any MCP-capable agent at it and it queries exactly the evidence it needs:</p>
  <div class="grid g3">
    <Card icon="file" d="0"><span slot="title"><code>list_says</code></span>Every spoken fragment with timestamps — the issue anchors.</Card>
    <Card icon="clock" d="40"><span slot="title"><code>events_around</code></span>Raw events in a time window, filtered by kind.</Card>
    <Card icon="layers" d="80"><span slot="title"><code>get_dom_state</code></span>Full DOM HTML nearest to a timestamp.</Card>
    <Card icon="zap" d="0"><span slot="title"><code>get_errors</code></span>Console errors, page errors, HTTP ≥ 400.</Card>
    <Card icon="box" d="40"><span slot="title"><code>get_shot / get_body</code></span>Screenshot frames and response payloads on demand.</Card>
    <Card icon="api" d="80"><span slot="title"><code>session_md</code></span>The rendered timeline when the agent wants it all.</Card>
    <Card icon="mic" d="100"><span slot="title"><code>get_asr / set_asr</code></span>The agent checks and flips the live speech engine itself — no human in the config loop.</Card>
  </div>
</div></section>

<div class="ruler"><b class="a">02:31</b><b class="b">STOP ■</b><i style="--x:94%"></i></div>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">07 · Principles</div>
  <h2 class="rv">Evidence never lies.</h2>
  <div class="grid g2">
    <Card icon="terminal" title="Local-first, zero config" d="0">System Edge/Chrome + free streaming ASR (doubao-web → doubao-ime → browser SR, switchable via <code>wit config asr</code>). No API key needed; LLM polish is an optional layer, never the pipeline.</Card>
    <Card icon="file" title="Words are never rewritten" d="80">Your speech lands verbatim in events.jsonl. Merging, correction and association are display-layer suggestions — the raw testimony stays auditable.</Card>
    <Card icon="eye" title="Evidence ≠ intent" d="0">Clicks and scrolls are facts, not complaints. Without a spoken anchor, agents are told explicitly: never infer a bug from behavior alone.</Card>
    <Card icon="shield" title="Privacy engineered in" d="80">Password fields masked in four channels; POST bodies redact credential fields; P freezes everything, mic included; <code>WIT_NO_BODIES</code> for sensitive apps.</Card>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="install"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">08 · Get started</div>
  <h2 class="rv">Three sentences. That's the whole loop.</h2>
  <p class="lede rv" data-d="60">You give instructions; <b>your agent runs the commands</b>. Witness is a CLI (<code>wit</code>) that agents drive — it opens a managed browser, records, and hands back a local evidence package: <code>review.html</code> for you, <code>session.md</code>/<code>PROMPT.md</code>/<code>wit mcp</code> for the agent. Node 18+, system Edge/Chrome, no cloud, no keys.</p>
  <Convo d="100" />
  <div class="cta rv" data-d="160" style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:30px">
    <a class="btn pri" href={GH}>★ Star on GitHub<svg class="ar" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    <a class="btn" href="/docs">Read the docs ↗</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
</Base>
